(6451533, 958023, 54645, '<td valign="top">A subtle story that satisfies the search.</td>', 'A subtle story that satisfies the search.', '2011-06-24 02:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451534, 957499, 54645, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2011-06-24 02:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451570, 957470, 29777, '<td valign="top">The colors on the horizon are wonderful.</td>', 'The colors on the horizon are wonderful.', '2011-06-24 03:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451571, 958185, 29777, '<td valign="top">Great moment captured.</td>', 'Great moment captured.', '2011-06-24 03:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451574, 958278, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition. At first glance it almost appears as a Cuervo ad. Then the words on the page and the title show the opposite.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition. At first glance it almost appears as a Cuervo ad. Then the words on the page and the title show the opposite.', '2011-06-24 03:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451575, 957726, 29777, '<td valign="top">This really made me laugh.</td>', 'This really made me laugh.', '2011-06-24 03:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451577, 957724, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this type of HDR shot. You couldn''t have picked a better title.</td>', 'I like this type of HDR shot. You couldn''t have picked a better title.', '2011-06-24 03:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451578, 958186, 29777, '<td valign="top">So far I haven''t found Waldo.</td>', 'So far I haven''t found Waldo.', '2011-06-24 03:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451579, 958094, 123833, '<td valign="top">How did you do it in just 5 months?? The improvement in lighting and PP is remarkable! What happened to the hair on your arm? ;) Very well done!</td>', 'How did you do it in just 5 months?? The improvement in lighting and PP is remarkable! What happened to the hair on your arm? ;) Very well done!', '2011-06-24 03:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451580, 958296, 29777, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting this one.</td>', 'I''m not getting this one.', '2011-06-24 03:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451581, 957295, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment. I don''t know exactly which photo this is a retake of, but I really like this pic. I love the motion in the clouds and the brightness of the blues.</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment. I don''t know exactly which photo this is a retake of, but I really like this pic. I love the motion in the clouds and the brightness of the blues.', '2011-06-24 03:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451583, 958275, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment. Can''t figure out which one this is a remake of, but I like this one a lot. The focus on the eye and just surrounding it is spot on. The catch light is perfect and the shallow DOF really works well here. Also, the vibrant colors are wonderful!</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment. Can''t figure out which one this is a remake of, but I like this one a lot. The focus on the eye and just surrounding it is spot on. The catch light is perfect and the shallow DOF really works well here. Also, the vibrant colors are wonderful!', '2011-06-24 03:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451584, 958269, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment. Cannot figure out the original pic, but I love this one!!! Great focus on the eyes and the color and tone are nice. This is wonderful indeed and one of my favs.</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment. Cannot figure out the original pic, but I love this one!!! Great focus on the eyes and the color and tone are nice. This is wonderful indeed and one of my favs.', '2011-06-24 03:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451585, 958177, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment...WOW, I want to live where you live!!!!! I''ve already voted and not changing my votes, but now am trying to find the original to compare to. If I found the correct one (which is spectacular), then a couple of things I like in this photo. I love the green background. but mostly I like that the full wings are in frame. I also really like the wings in this position instead of out to the sides (don''t know why, I just do). I really like this capture. If I am comparing to the wrong pic, then everything I said is still true :-) One of the favs.</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment...WOW, I want to live where you live!!!!! I''ve already voted and not changing my votes, but now am trying to find the original to compare to. If I found the correct one (which is spectacular), then a couple of things I like in this photo. I love the green background. but mostly I like that the full wings are in frame. I also really like the wings in this position instead of out to the sides (don''t know why, I just do). I really like this capture. If I am comparing to the wrong pic, then everything I said is still true :-) One of the favs.', '2011-06-24 04:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451670, 958094, 43774, '<td valign="top">Much better than your original entry, great job!!</td>', 'Much better than your original entry, great job!!', '2011-06-24 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451692, 958094, 10785, '<td valign="top">Definite improvement over your first photo. The lighting is much better. I noticed how you got some shadow on the front of your forearm, like in the poster which suggests you used good side lighting from camera right. The sharpness is uber on this take! I like your take on this subject and I can''t offer any improvements. I can offer alternatives because there are always a thousand ways you can do one thing. Some alternatives to try in your processing might be to add some noise or a bit of soft focus to the image. When I look at the poster images, the use of the printing technique seemed to give some speckling to the poster, which is why I suggested noise. Also in the poster, Rosie still gave off that feminine mystique so I think maybe some soft focus might aid in that in your shot. Also I thought it might make it more true to the era rather than the HD shot you have here. Just suggestions though, not real critiques.</td>', 'Definite improvement over your first photo. The lighting is much better. I noticed how you got some shadow on the front of your forearm, like in the poster which suggests you used good side lighting from camera right. The sharpness is uber on this take! I like your take on this subject and I can''t offer any improvements. I can offer alternatives because there are always a thousand ways you can do one thing. Some alternatives to try in your processing might be to add some noise or a bit of soft focus to the image. When I look at the poster images, the use of the printing technique seemed to give some speckling to the poster, which is why I suggested noise. Also in the poster, Rosie still gave off that feminine mystique so I think maybe some soft focus might aid in that in your shot. Also I thought it might make it more true to the era rather than the HD shot you have here. Just suggestions though, not real critiques.', '2011-06-24 09:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451695, 957428, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nothing really improved on this shot. The added blackness really doesn''t help. I think you should have gone and re-shot your bees in the back yard again!</td>', 'Nothing really improved on this shot. The added blackness really doesn''t help. I think you should have gone and re-shot your bees in the back yard again!', '2011-06-24 09:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451697, 958048, 15711, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely, especially that golden "bar" to the left in the foreground. I like the perspective and the sun not being dead center.</td>', 'Quite lovely, especially that golden "bar" to the left in the foreground. I like the perspective and the sun not being dead center.', '2011-06-24 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451698, 957739, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  For some reason, I want to "straighten it out" by rotating the image slightly (2 degrees maybe) to the right.</td>', 'Interesting.  For some reason, I want to "straighten it out" by rotating the image slightly (2 degrees maybe) to the right.', '2011-06-24 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451700, 957517, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  On my monitor, though, the blue background is a tad "off."  I can''t think of the word, but sometimes if you adjust saturation, or levels, it gets this effect.  I wish I knew the proper term.</td>', 'Great focus.  On my monitor, though, the blue background is a tad "off."  I can''t think of the word, but sometimes if you adjust saturation, or levels, it gets this effect.  I wish I knew the proper term.', '2011-06-24 09:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451702, 958094, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - the classic poster personified.  Excellent.</td>', 'Wow - the classic poster personified.  Excellent.', '2011-06-24 09:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451704, 957688, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is wonderful.  Looks very "Texas" to me.  The negative space in the middle is great.  If I were to nitpick anything, maybe not cutting off part of the shrub to the right of the horses, but no big deal.  Love the muted palette and those clouds!  Any photo with a horse, cow or dog, always gets an extra point, so that would make it a 9.  GOOD GOING.</td>', 'Oh this is wonderful.  Looks very "Texas" to me.  The negative space in the middle is great.  If I were to nitpick anything, maybe not cutting off part of the shrub to the right of the horses, but no big deal.  Love the muted palette and those clouds!  Any photo with a horse, cow or dog, always gets an extra point, so that would make it a 9.  GOOD GOING.', '2011-06-24 09:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451705, 958269, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really great.  This could work for the Nat''l Geo challenge too.  If I would critique anything, it would be the angle of the shot.  I understand that you might not have been able to get down as low as you''d like.</td>', 'Really great.  This could work for the Nat''l Geo challenge too.  If I would critique anything, it would be the angle of the shot.  I understand that you might not have been able to get down as low as you''d like.', '2011-06-24 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451707, 957795, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely and serene.  If it were mine, I would have liked to see a closer look at the pylons and the pelicans. :)</td>', 'Lovely and serene.  If it were mine, I would have liked to see a closer look at the pylons and the pelicans. :)', '2011-06-24 09:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451708, 958273, 15711, '<td valign="top">Technically good.  Her expression seems a tad forced.  I wonder what it would have looked like if we were able to see both of her eyes.  Great catch light. :)</td>', 'Technically good.  Her expression seems a tad forced.  I wonder what it would have looked like if we were able to see both of her eyes.  Great catch light. :)', '2011-06-24 09:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451709, 957537, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene.  Would it have looked "fake" if you dodged the white of the building a smidge?  Just a thought. :) 7</td>', 'What a beautiful scene.  Would it have looked "fake" if you dodged the white of the building a smidge?  Just a thought. :) 7', '2011-06-24 09:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451710, 958185, 15711, '<td valign="top">This tells a great story.  Seeing a monk with a beanie strikes me as very modern and odd. :) 7</td>', 'This tells a great story.  Seeing a monk with a beanie strikes me as very modern and odd. :) 7', '2011-06-24 09:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451711, 958232, 15711, '<td valign="top">When I wear my straw cowboy hat, I don''t look a think like that. :)  LOL</td>', 'When I wear my straw cowboy hat, I don''t look a think like that. :)  LOL', '2011-06-24 09:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451712, 957724, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I love the rich textures of the clouds and shore.  The complimentary deep blues and rich browns really work together.  This would be great enlarged really BIG on a canvas. :)</td>', 'Stunning.  I love the rich textures of the clouds and shore.  The complimentary deep blues and rich browns really work together.  This would be great enlarged really BIG on a canvas. :)', '2011-06-24 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451713, 958204, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh feel of it.  Almost bleached out.  NICE!!</td>', 'I like the harsh feel of it.  Almost bleached out.  NICE!!', '2011-06-24 09:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451715, 958120, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - this looks like a Nat''l Geo entry!!  I love a silhouette.  What a great story in a single shot. :)</td>', 'WOW - this looks like a Nat''l Geo entry!!  I love a silhouette.  What a great story in a single shot. :)', '2011-06-24 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451719, 957726, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  that is hilarious!!  I''m sure not everyone will get the tee shirt''s reference, but it''s really funny.  I''m trying to read the graffiti behind her. Face off?</td>', 'ROFL  that is hilarious!!  I''m sure not everyone will get the tee shirt''s reference, but it''s really funny.  I''m trying to read the graffiti behind her. Face off?', '2011-06-24 09:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451720, 958117, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus.  It''s a shame that most of the hummingbird shots include those tacky plastic feeders, but without them, you''d never get the shot. :)</td>', 'Excellent focus.  It''s a shame that most of the hummingbird shots include those tacky plastic feeders, but without them, you''d never get the shot. :)', '2011-06-24 09:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451721, 958258, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m craving a closer look at him with less of the trunk of the tree, although that hole certainly indicates a possible nest inside (?)</td>', 'I''m craving a closer look at him with less of the trunk of the tree, although that hole certainly indicates a possible nest inside (?)', '2011-06-24 09:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451723, 958137, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  Blur is so underrated.  It doesn''t always work, but this really does (for me). 7</td>', 'Oh I love this.  Blur is so underrated.  It doesn''t always work, but this really does (for me). 7', '2011-06-24 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451724, 957295, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a trip to Lake Tahoe.  That blue is just gorgeous.</td>', 'Reminds me of a trip to Lake Tahoe.  That blue is just gorgeous.', '2011-06-24 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451725, 958238, 15711, '<td valign="top">Steaming roses?  Bird''s nests?  Interesting indeed.</td>', 'Steaming roses?  Bird''s nests?  Interesting indeed.', '2011-06-24 09:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451726, 958221, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really pretty but I wish we could see more detail and nuance of the white petals. :) Maybe some burn of the midtones. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Really pretty but I wish we could see more detail and nuance of the white petals. :) Maybe some burn of the midtones. Just a thought. :)', '2011-06-24 09:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451735, 957606, 111483, '<td valign="top">very nice painting very colorfull ,nice frame,great job i realy like this</td>', 'very nice painting very colorfull ,nice frame,great job i realy like this', '2011-06-24 10:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451738, 958232, 132764, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpness in this image!</td>', 'Love the sharpness in this image!', '2011-06-24 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451755, 958177, 36843, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture</td>', 'Lovely capture', '2011-06-24 10:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451757, 957295, 117474, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular. I can certainly see this on the front page</td>', 'This is spectacular. I can certainly see this on the front page', '2011-06-24 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451762, 958120, 117474, '<td valign="top">This must be yours Steve. Front page potential I''m sure. Wonderful split toning. I wonder if you''re gonna have issues if you show the before and after shots :)</td>', 'This must be yours Steve. Front page potential I''m sure. Wonderful split toning. I wonder if you''re gonna have issues if you show the before and after shots :)', '2011-06-24 10:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451782, 958177, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice job Wendy. I voted this a 10, one of my top 3 shots then I decided to see if I could find the original. Your original was great but I really like how you changed the orientation and the subjects are close together. You take excellent wildlife shots, good luck.</td>', 'Nice job Wendy. I voted this a 10, one of my top 3 shots then I decided to see if I could find the original. Your original was great but I really like how you changed the orientation and the subjects are close together. You take excellent wildlife shots, good luck.', '2011-06-24 11:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451783, 958094, 113278, '<td valign="top">Voted this as one of my top 3 favorites of the challenge then found the original. You got an excellent score last go around but you have really polished this one up nicely. I expect to see it finish quite high. Good luck.</td>', 'Voted this as one of my top 3 favorites of the challenge then found the original. You got an excellent score last go around but you have really polished this one up nicely. I expect to see it finish quite high. Good luck.', '2011-06-24 11:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451784, 958232, 113278, '<td valign="top">You really have an eye for making great photos. This is sexy and artistic and all around a great shot. a 10 from me.</td>', 'You really have an eye for making great photos. This is sexy and artistic and all around a great shot. a 10 from me.', '2011-06-24 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451805, 958249, 117474, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of HDR and wide angle photography.</td>', 'Excellent use of HDR and wide angle photography.', '2011-06-24 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451815, 957517, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one seems familiar. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59029" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Snaffles</a>? At any rate, I recall the original. HUGE improvement on this. Should do well.</td>', 'This one seems familiar.  Snaffles? At any rate, I recall the original. HUGE improvement on this. Should do well.', '2011-06-24 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451817, 958211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Extra pointage for the great border.</td>', 'Extra pointage for the great border.', '2011-06-24 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451819, 958236, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too centered vertically to me, but otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'Seems a bit too centered vertically to me, but otherwise nicely done.', '2011-06-24 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451822, 958107, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, um, er... shoes.</td>', 'Nice, um, er... shoes.', '2011-06-24 13:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451824, 957726, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hehe, love the T-shirt. Could very likely be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=112828" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Cory</a> entry.</td>', 'Hehe, love the T-shirt. Could very likely be a  Cory entry.', '2011-06-24 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451827, 958185, 100831, '<td valign="top">wonderful! Great fit for the challenge.</td>', 'wonderful! Great fit for the challenge.', '2011-06-24 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451836, 958173, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a reshoot of an entry by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=14476" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sfalice</a>. I must say you have really improved the image tremendously. The full color and the saturation really pops. It looks like something out of a ''50''s technicolor movie or something! I also think you may have tried some perspective correction because the columns in your last entry look somewhat curved and these look nice and straight... Great Job.<br/> <br/>One of the few critiques I could give is about the dark water. Other than that... It Pops!!</td>', 'I think this is a reshoot of an entry by  sfalice. I must say you have really improved the image tremendously. The full color and the saturation really pops. It looks like something out of a ''50''s technicolor movie or something! I also think you may have tried some perspective correction because the columns in your last entry look somewhat curved and these look nice and straight... Great Job. One of the few critiques I could give is about the dark water. Other than that... It Pops!!', '2011-06-24 14:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451839, 958252, 10785, '<td valign="top">There are so many images titles "Soaring" I couldn''t begin to come up with what this shot is a re-take of, so I can''t offer any good comments regarding your update. It does show good movement which adds to the dynamic of the photo. Good use of rule of thirds too. I think it would have been better to get the bird flying solo without another in the sky. But other than that, the lighting is real good with the underside of the bird being lit real well even though it is in shadow.</td>', 'There are so many images titles "Soaring" I couldn''t begin to come up with what this shot is a re-take of, so I can''t offer any good comments regarding your update. It does show good movement which adds to the dynamic of the photo. Good use of rule of thirds too. I think it would have been better to get the bird flying solo without another in the sky. But other than that, the lighting is real good with the underside of the bird being lit real well even though it is in shadow.', '2011-06-24 14:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451840, 958259, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is splendid. The faces and varied action is engaging, and I like the "imperfect" highlights. Makes it real. 9</td>', 'Wow. This is splendid. The faces and varied action is engaging, and I like the "imperfect" highlights. Makes it real. 9', '2011-06-24 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451843, 958186, 10785, '<td valign="top">A photographer I admire and an image I remember without having to look it up. I like the new crop on this shot and the warmer colors. The leading line from the zig-zagging wires really takes you through the street to the end. In your last shot, the scene felt somewhat cut off due to the square crop. One thing I miss about this shot from the other one is the details. Being so close up in the other shot brought me more into the scene. That is a matter of the site image size restriction though. Surely this is a bigger image and if you had the same width as before, this shot would be just as spectacular. Overall a nice improvement I would just like to see it bigger, but that does not affect my vote.</td>', 'A photographer I admire and an image I remember without having to look it up. I like the new crop on this shot and the warmer colors. The leading line from the zig-zagging wires really takes you through the street to the end. In your last shot, the scene felt somewhat cut off due to the square crop. One thing I miss about this shot from the other one is the details. Being so close up in the other shot brought me more into the scene. That is a matter of the site image size restriction though. Surely this is a bigger image and if you had the same width as before, this shot would be just as spectacular. Overall a nice improvement I would just like to see it bigger, but that does not affect my vote.', '2011-06-24 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451914, 958275, 108069, '<td valign="top">Stunning clarity, colors and bokeh. This is flat out a severely professional shot. Excellent.</td>', 'Stunning clarity, colors and bokeh. This is flat out a severely professional shot. Excellent.', '2011-06-24 17:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451915, 957295, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Icy tones and colors, and the detail in the pebbles has to be seen to be believed. The low cloud adds a graceful motion to it as well. Excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Icy tones and colors, and the detail in the pebbles has to be seen to be believed. The low cloud adds a graceful motion to it as well. Excellent.', '2011-06-24 17:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451941, 957795, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like the sea level is about 6 inches higher! Anyway, fantastic redo. Such greater clarity and composition. Your previous photo left me feeling boxed in because of the line of the wharf leading to the left and the focal point of the sunset to the right. Here, the sunset is in a much better position and the lines point right to it. It gives a much better sense of open space! Well done!</td>', 'Wow, looks like the sea level is about 6 inches higher! Anyway, fantastic redo. Such greater clarity and composition. Your previous photo left me feeling boxed in because of the line of the wharf leading to the left and the focal point of the sunset to the right. Here, the sunset is in a much better position and the lines point right to it. It gives a much better sense of open space! Well done!', '2011-06-24 17:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452038, 958221, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful photo. The contrast between the detail of the center and the subtly defined petals and the non-existent background is captivating. My eyes are darting back and forth. Wonderful photo.</td>', 'Quite a beautiful photo. The contrast between the detail of the center and the subtly defined petals and the non-existent background is captivating. My eyes are darting back and forth. Wonderful photo.', '2011-06-24 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452099, 958131, 64446, '<td valign="top">Lovelly, indeed!!! Not sure if showing more of her head (tried to avoid a pony tail?) and back would help in any way. I like how her hand is positioned as she seems to be in deep thoughts... Very well done!</td>', 'Lovelly, indeed!!! Not sure if showing more of her head (tried to avoid a pony tail?) and back would help in any way. I like how her hand is positioned as she seems to be in deep thoughts... Very well done!', '2011-06-24 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452106, 958211, 64446, '<td valign="top">My first impression was: "what a waste of my time!"<br/>But this is very clever... very interesting thumnail effect... or when looking from afar. I think you''ll be hammered, but I really like it!</td>', 'My first impression was: "what a waste of my time!"But this is very clever... very interesting thumnail effect... or when looking from afar. I think you''ll be hammered, but I really like it!', '2011-06-24 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452108, 957295, 132996, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous long exposure! I always love the effect it has on the clouds. The colors here are gorgeous also. The multitude of shades of blue is so delightful! I also love the reflections in the water. The long streaks always remind me of watching <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=jvmBQGWOSb8" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bob Ross''s joy of painting</a>. The peace in those paintings reminds me of the peace in this photograph. I like your framing with the evergreens, but I think it might be a bit too much on the right side of the image. That one tree is obstructing a beautiful mountain peak. I think the framing on the left side is a little more appropriate to highlight the beautiful mountains.</td>', 'Gorgeous long exposure! I always love the effect it has on the clouds. The colors here are gorgeous also. The multitude of shades of blue is so delightful! I also love the reflections in the water. The long streaks always remind me of watching Bob Ross''s joy of painting. The peace in those paintings reminds me of the peace in this photograph. I like your framing with the evergreens, but I think it might be a bit too much on the right side of the image. That one tree is obstructing a beautiful mountain peak. I think the framing on the left side is a little more appropriate to highlight the beautiful mountains.', '2011-06-24 22:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
