(6453006, 958185, 58634, '<td valign="top">To me, it seems a tad underexposed. I take it this was probably a cloudy day..  I think this would look better if you would''ve taken it from a different angle, maybe to the right of the photographer so that you would capture the photographer and what he/she is photographing, if that makes sense, that way hopefully cropping out some of the distracting people in this image such as the person in the background wearing red.</td>', 'To me, it seems a tad underexposed. I take it this was probably a cloudy day..  I think this would look better if you would''ve taken it from a different angle, maybe to the right of the photographer so that you would capture the photographer and what he/she is photographing, if that makes sense, that way hopefully cropping out some of the distracting people in this image such as the person in the background wearing red.', '2011-06-26 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
