(6453105, 958186, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really really like your processing of this. I''m not sure if you did HDR or not, but these colors and details are spectacular.<br/> <br/>The lines throughout the image are also spectacular. This is one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I really really like your processing of this. I''m not sure if you did HDR or not, but these colors and details are spectacular. The lines throughout the image are also spectacular. This is one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2011-06-26 17:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453109, 958185, 114225, '<td valign="top">Is this somehow a reproduction of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=138280" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/301/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_138280.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/301/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_138280.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/301/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_138280.jpg"/></a>? If so, that''s kind of a stretch. But this is a much better photograph. The only thing I don''t like is the people coming out of the frontmost monk''s head.</td>', 'Is this somehow a reproduction of ? If so, that''s kind of a stretch. But this is a much better photograph. The only thing I don''t like is the people coming out of the frontmost monk''s head.', '2011-06-26 17:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453110, 958265, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective to highlight the lines and colors of this cool scene.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective to highlight the lines and colors of this cool scene.', '2011-06-26 17:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453111, 958048, 114225, '<td valign="top">The use of the rocks to point to the sun is fantastic. The colors are great. But the details seem very soft on the rocks where I expect them to be crisp.</td>', 'The use of the rocks to point to the sun is fantastic. The colors are great. But the details seem very soft on the rocks where I expect them to be crisp.', '2011-06-26 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453114, 958169, 114225, '<td valign="top">One critique that I often have (and get form others) with photos like this is the out of focus foreground posts. It seems like this type of shot works best if the whole thing is in perfect focus, or if the frontmost posts are in focus. When it''s opposite, it somehow seems distracting.</td>', 'One critique that I often have (and get form others) with photos like this is the out of focus foreground posts. It seems like this type of shot works best if the whole thing is in perfect focus, or if the frontmost posts are in focus. When it''s opposite, it somehow seems distracting.', '2011-06-26 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453115, 958204, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective and straight lines that contradict the curves and movement of the clouds.</td>', 'I really like the perspective and straight lines that contradict the curves and movement of the clouds.', '2011-06-26 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453117, 958117, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus. Looks at those little tiny feet getting ready to land.</td>', 'Beautiful focus. Looks at those little tiny feet getting ready to land.', '2011-06-26 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453120, 957292, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, I probably don''t appreciate this photo as much as others. But I do appreciate the different angles of lines and tones.</td>', 'Overall, I probably don''t appreciate this photo as much as others. But I do appreciate the different angles of lines and tones.', '2011-06-26 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453124, 958079, 114225, '<td valign="top">I believe I recall your original, but with enough clarity to know if this is an improvement. I do really like the clean sunburst through the flower and the lack of blown highlights in the surrounding sky.</td>', 'I believe I recall your original, but with enough clarity to know if this is an improvement. I do really like the clean sunburst through the flower and the lack of blown highlights in the surrounding sky.', '2011-06-26 18:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453125, 958041, 114225, '<td valign="top">What beautiful scenery to put a cemetery in. I do like the perspective, but feel the contrast of the image is a bit low (gives a slightly washed out feeling).</td>', 'What beautiful scenery to put a cemetery in. I do like the perspective, but feel the contrast of the image is a bit low (gives a slightly washed out feeling).', '2011-06-26 18:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453126, 958131, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a vintage looking shot, especially the facial expression. To me, that expression shows more vintage than the color, focus, and noise.</td>', 'Definitely a vintage looking shot, especially the facial expression. To me, that expression shows more vintage than the color, focus, and noise.', '2011-06-26 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453128, 958278, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo for what is such a depressing occasion. To me, that wedding photo is a lovely view into this man''s mind.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo for what is such a depressing occasion. To me, that wedding photo is a lovely view into this man''s mind.', '2011-06-26 18:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453136, 957517, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like this subject against the deep sapphire background. However, I''m feeling the overhead light is causing a bit too deep of shadows on the cookie.</td>', 'I really like this subject against the deep sapphire background. However, I''m feeling the overhead light is causing a bit too deep of shadows on the cookie.', '2011-06-26 18:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453139, 958273, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo. I''m still not sure how I feel about an eye covered up. I know to some it adds a sense of mystery, but to me it takes away half of the most important feature to a woman''s face.</td>', 'Very pretty photo. I''m still not sure how I feel about an eye covered up. I know to some it adds a sense of mystery, but to me it takes away half of the most important feature to a woman''s face.', '2011-06-26 18:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453140, 958173, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the view point. The colors seem to indicate an early morning shot where the sun is barely cresting the horizon.</td>', 'I like the view point. The colors seem to indicate an early morning shot where the sun is barely cresting the horizon.', '2011-06-26 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453142, 958107, 114225, '<td valign="top">In Cartier-Bresson style, I think the blur of movement is spot on. But I wonder if that will end up hurting your overall score (I would have likely take a point off for it without the title).</td>', 'In Cartier-Bresson style, I think the blur of movement is spot on. But I wonder if that will end up hurting your overall score (I would have likely take a point off for it without the title).', '2011-06-26 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453145, 958222, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those are some amazing colors in the sky. Was it really like that?<br/>This feels slightly like a lensbaby, as it seem like a scene like this would be fully in focus. Either way, it''s pretty cool.</td>', 'Those are some amazing colors in the sky. Was it really like that?This feels slightly like a lensbaby, as it seem like a scene like this would be fully in focus. Either way, it''s pretty cool.', '2011-06-26 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453146, 958183, 114225, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the humor, but don''t really appreciate the photo.</td>', 'I appreciate the humor, but don''t really appreciate the photo.', '2011-06-26 18:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453147, 958236, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great tones to this image. It''s very soothing and energetic at the same time.</td>', 'Great tones to this image. It''s very soothing and energetic at the same time.', '2011-06-26 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453149, 957688, 114225, '<td valign="top">The colors of this photo really take it to the next level. It''s great to start off with a perfectly composed scene, but you add those colors and it comes alive.</td>', 'The colors of this photo really take it to the next level. It''s great to start off with a perfectly composed scene, but you add those colors and it comes alive.', '2011-06-26 18:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453151, 957470, 114225, '<td valign="top">The hint of sunlight in this scene it what makes it really great to me. That contrast in colors is very cool.</td>', 'The hint of sunlight in this scene it what makes it really great to me. That contrast in colors is very cool.', '2011-06-26 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453152, 958249, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. The processing of this is simply spectacular. It seems to transport me to another time.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. The processing of this is simply spectacular. It seems to transport me to another time.', '2011-06-26 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453153, 957295, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene with great framing. That low hanging cloud does get in the way, but at the same time it adds a lot of interest.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene with great framing. That low hanging cloud does get in the way, but at the same time it adds a lot of interest.', '2011-06-26 18:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453154, 957726, 114225, '<td valign="top">Tough decision, but a really cute photo. That facial expression is one I really enjoy.</td>', 'Tough decision, but a really cute photo. That facial expression is one I really enjoy.', '2011-06-26 18:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453155, 957954, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in this city. It''s amazing how much color can be shown in a photo like this. I do seem to think the details are just a tiny bit soft. Sharpen it up and then you really have something great.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in this city. It''s amazing how much color can be shown in a photo like this. I do seem to think the details are just a tiny bit soft. Sharpen it up and then you really have something great.', '2011-06-26 18:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453156, 957537, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really want to be there. The serenity of nice fall fall on a clam cool lake is just so inviting.</td>', 'I really want to be there. The serenity of nice fall fall on a clam cool lake is just so inviting.', '2011-06-26 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453157, 958023, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of tones and leading lines in this image.</td>', 'Wonderful use of tones and leading lines in this image.', '2011-06-26 18:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453158, 958110, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a supremely cool building. Those exact lines and angles of the structure really contradict the painting style, which is what makes this so interesting to me.</td>', 'That''s a supremely cool building. Those exact lines and angles of the structure really contradict the painting style, which is what makes this so interesting to me.', '2011-06-26 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453162, 958131, 58634, '<td valign="top">This one has feeling to it. I like.</td>', 'This one has feeling to it. I like.', '2011-06-26 18:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453164, 958214, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is ok, but it has a lot of potential to be better. To me, it seems like she is lazily laying her head down. The colors and style of this image say "power" and "energy" to me which is the opposite of lazy laying.</td>', 'I think the photo is ok, but it has a lot of potential to be better. To me, it seems like she is lazily laying her head down. The colors and style of this image say "power" and "energy" to me which is the opposite of lazy laying.', '2011-06-26 18:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453165, 958284, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how the shirt really blends into the skin. It''s hard to see a shirt there.<br/>Love the look in the eyes for this photo.</td>', 'It''s funny how the shirt really blends into the skin. It''s hard to see a shirt there.Love the look in the eyes for this photo.', '2011-06-26 18:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453166, 957779, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene with fantastic dynamics and motion.</td>', 'Beautiful scene with fantastic dynamics and motion.', '2011-06-26 18:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453167, 958269, 114225, '<td valign="top">I always like the prehistoric stare of these animals. It really sends out a sense of fear.</td>', 'I always like the prehistoric stare of these animals. It really sends out a sense of fear.', '2011-06-26 18:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453168, 958276, 114225, '<td valign="top">The curve of the caterpillar adds a lot to this image. Unfortunately, to me the blown red highlights take something away.</td>', 'The curve of the caterpillar adds a lot to this image. Unfortunately, to me the blown red highlights take something away.', '2011-06-26 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453169, 958296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting silhouette choice. I''m still trying to figure out if I like it or hate it.</td>', 'Interesting silhouette choice. I''m still trying to figure out if I like it or hate it.', '2011-06-26 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453170, 958212, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this plant looks like a pterodactyl with a bad hairdo. Do what you will with that information :)</td>', 'To me, this plant looks like a pterodactyl with a bad hairdo. Do what you will with that information :)', '2011-06-26 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453171, 958285, 114225, '<td valign="top">The head bands and scarves add a little extra something to this image. Without them, I think I wouldn''t have liked it as much.</td>', 'The head bands and scarves add a little extra something to this image. Without them, I think I wouldn''t have liked it as much.', '2011-06-26 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453172, 957795, 114225, '<td valign="top">Splendid colors and lines. Seems like the big boys on the dock are bullying the little birds off of it.</td>', 'Splendid colors and lines. Seems like the big boys on the dock are bullying the little birds off of it.', '2011-06-26 18:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453173, 958137, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool duality to this movement.</td>', 'Cool duality to this movement.', '2011-06-26 18:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453175, 958221, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous details in the center with a nice softness to the petals. Those things combine to make a pleasing photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous details in the center with a nice softness to the petals. Those things combine to make a pleasing photo.', '2011-06-26 18:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453176, 957335, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of selective desaturation. Normally I''m not a huge fan of that technique, but this has been applied well.</td>', 'Interesting use of selective desaturation. Normally I''m not a huge fan of that technique, but this has been applied well.', '2011-06-26 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453177, 958277, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors of this photo, but which the sharpness wasn''t so stark. It''s taking away from the actual details of the photo.</td>', 'I really like the colors of this photo, but which the sharpness wasn''t so stark. It''s taking away from the actual details of the photo.', '2011-06-26 18:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453178, 957470, 58634, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous is not enough to describe this as.</td>', 'Gorgeous is not enough to describe this as.', '2011-06-26 18:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453179, 958297, 114225, '<td valign="top">The frames really add to the destruction. If it were just the cinder blocks, I don''t think there would be as much interest in this photo.</td>', 'The frames really add to the destruction. If it were just the cinder blocks, I don''t think there would be as much interest in this photo.', '2011-06-26 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453180, 958275, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the details and colors of the face against that blue and violet bokeh background. Those colors all work very well together.</td>', 'I really enjoy the details and colors of the face against that blue and violet bokeh background. Those colors all work very well together.', '2011-06-26 18:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453182, 957739, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of gold and blue. I''m not really liking the tilt. This photo seems to scream that it needs symmetry.</td>', 'Very cool use of gold and blue. I''m not really liking the tilt. This photo seems to scream that it needs symmetry.', '2011-06-26 18:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453183, 957499, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of blur. The basic shapes of this image really come out and make something special.</td>', 'Interesting use of blur. The basic shapes of this image really come out and make something special.', '2011-06-26 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453184, 958274, 114225, '<td valign="top">Seems almost more like the peeing than the running (the one back leg look to be in the air). I''m not really into this photo, unfortunately.</td>', 'Seems almost more like the peeing than the running (the one back leg look to be in the air). I''m not really into this photo, unfortunately.', '2011-06-26 18:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453185, 958279, 114225, '<td valign="top">The softness here is very cool. Are they molting? I wish the image were just a touch brighter.</td>', 'The softness here is very cool. Are they molting? I wish the image were just a touch brighter.', '2011-06-26 18:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453186, 958093, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the line of foam leads to his left foot. Also interesting how there is a dream-like feeling to this.</td>', 'It''s interesting how the line of foam leads to his left foot. Also interesting how there is a dream-like feeling to this.', '2011-06-26 18:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453187, 958115, 114225, '<td valign="top">The play of lines in this image are nice. With the train tracks, the care lights, and then the building. They work to pull everything together.</td>', 'The play of lines in this image are nice. With the train tracks, the care lights, and then the building. They work to pull everything together.', '2011-06-26 18:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453188, 958245, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great softness in her face (especially the perspective).</td>', 'Great softness in her face (especially the perspective).', '2011-06-26 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453189, 958033, 114225, '<td valign="top">I feel like there should be a story behind the colors of this photo, but I''m not quite getting anything there.</td>', 'I feel like there should be a story behind the colors of this photo, but I''m not quite getting anything there.', '2011-06-26 18:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453190, 958238, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the scene, especially the details in the apple and the placement of the pencils.</td>', 'I really like the scene, especially the details in the apple and the placement of the pencils.', '2011-06-26 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453191, 957606, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m finding it hard to fit the title of this image with the image itself.</td>', 'I''m finding it hard to fit the title of this image with the image itself.', '2011-06-26 18:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453192, 958239, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the scene, but I''m having a hard time looking at it due to the radioactive foreground.</td>', 'I really like the scene, but I''m having a hard time looking at it due to the radioactive foreground.', '2011-06-26 18:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453193, 958282, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the way the little flowers interplay with the dominance of the rose.</td>', 'I like the way the little flowers interplay with the dominance of the rose.', '2011-06-26 18:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453194, 958184, 114225, '<td valign="top">I haven''t found the original, but I do like this. The tones of this image say a lot about the scene.</td>', 'I haven''t found the original, but I do like this. The tones of this image say a lot about the scene.', '2011-06-26 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453195, 957720, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s very cool to me how the ends of the cone seem to drip down which the needles seem to pull up.</td>', 'It''s very cool to me how the ends of the cone seem to drip down which the needles seem to pull up.', '2011-06-26 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453196, 957428, 114225, '<td valign="top">I remember your original entry. I certainly like the idea/story behind this image. It''s wonderful as a personal photograph, but as a challenge entry I don''t see it doing well.</td>', 'I remember your original entry. I certainly like the idea/story behind this image. It''s wonderful as a personal photograph, but as a challenge entry I don''t see it doing well.', '2011-06-26 18:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453197, 957781, 114225, '<td valign="top">The tones of this are breathtaking. Hard to say much else when you can breathe :)</td>', 'The tones of this are breathtaking. Hard to say much else when you can breathe :)', '2011-06-26 18:57:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6453198, 958266, 114225, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of green here, almost too much for me.</td>', 'There''s a lot of green here, almost too much for me.', '2011-06-26 18:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453200, 958208, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can smell the citrus wafting from here. I like the inclusion of the water droplets.</td>', 'I can smell the citrus wafting from here. I like the inclusion of the water droplets.', '2011-06-26 18:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453208, 958079, 58634, '<td valign="top">I definitely hope you ribbon :) Although the main flower isn''t fully in focus.</td>', 'I definitely hope you ribbon :) Although the main flower isn''t fully in focus.', '2011-06-26 19:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453213, 958023, 58634, '<td valign="top">The shadows and highlights here are phenomenal. Love the textures here, too. 10</td>', 'The shadows and highlights here are phenomenal. Love the textures here, too. 10', '2011-06-26 19:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453214, 958249, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is incredible. I absolutely love EVERYTHING about it.. the way the clouds look so menacing.. yet we see a glimmer of light coming from the other side.. <br/>I hope you ribbon, because this one is my favorite! <br/>I hope you share your technique with us, too.<br/> <br/> <br/>10</td>', 'This is incredible. I absolutely love EVERYTHING about it.. the way the clouds look so menacing.. yet we see a glimmer of light coming from the other side.. I hope you ribbon, because this one is my favorite! I hope you share your technique with us, too.  10', '2011-06-26 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453215, 957688, 58634, '<td valign="top">Well now, the colors in this picture are spectacular. I like the fat that we have a ''slanted'' horizon too. It adds an oomph to the image. This is my pick for 2nd place. Excellent!</td>', 'Well now, the colors in this picture are spectacular. I like the fat that we have a ''slanted'' horizon too. It adds an oomph to the image. This is my pick for 2nd place. Excellent!', '2011-06-26 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453218, 957781, 58634, '<td valign="top">You achieved some incredible warm colors here.</td>', 'You achieved some incredible warm colors here.', '2011-06-26 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453219, 958177, 58634, '<td valign="top">The focus is so excellent in this, it''s breathtaking. Great capture!</td>', 'The focus is so excellent in this, it''s breathtaking. Great capture!', '2011-06-26 19:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453220, 958232, 58634, '<td valign="top">WOW! This image is STUNNING. The black and white works amazing for this, the focus is soft, yet sharp and the bokeh in this really compliments the image. <br/> <br/>The only tiny little thing is the tip of the elbow being cut off, but with a gorgeous image like this, I don''t see that as being a problem.</td>', 'WOW! This image is STUNNING. The black and white works amazing for this, the focus is soft, yet sharp and the bokeh in this really compliments the image.  The only tiny little thing is the tip of the elbow being cut off, but with a gorgeous image like this, I don''t see that as being a problem.', '2011-06-26 19:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453221, 958120, 58634, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. I think I might know who this is, but I''m not sure, lol. <br/> <br/>Love this image. It''s a beautiful silhouette.</td>', 'Hmm.. I think I might know who this is, but I''m not sure, lol.  Love this image. It''s a beautiful silhouette.', '2011-06-26 19:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453227, 957890, 117474, '<td valign="top">Lets start off with the... ''cons'' I see in this image (take everything I say with a grain of salt--I''m far from qualified in photography, and even less in still life style shots!). <br/>This image captured my eye when I voted in the challenge. What grabbed my attention first was the glass. And the dark line that''s going down the side of it. Unfortunatly to my eyes it didn''t help the image. It made me think that the photographer was... maybe clumsy in setting up his shot with a crack showing in it.  <br/>The next thing I thought about was the oranges. They''re find oranges that I wouldn''t hesitate to eat, but they don''t have the... zest (heh heh heh) that a fruit still life needs to score well. I''m awful at these things so I''m nobody to recommend anything. But, the textures on the orange on the right isn''t very pleasant to me... <br/> <br/>Pros: <br/>The lighting is great. Nothing''s too bright. Nothing''s too dark. It shows the droplets on the side of the glass to great effect. And it enhances the textures ov everything wonderfully (glass, oranges, knife, board). <br/>Sharpness is excellent over all the items photographed. And the wall behind is out of focus enough to not distract. Perhaps it could do with being more so, but it''s fine for me. <br/> <br/>Comparison to take one: <br/>The colour brings a lot to this image. The whole scene feels warmer than the black and white version. This fits in with my imagination of oranges growing in tropical bliss. In the black and white version the light was a little harsher in some places. I think you overcame that well here. <br/> <br/>Something that I''d''ve done differently: <br/>I think that some sort of continuous colour grounding and background would have suited this image well. Like what h2 does in his sometimes, if you know what I mean. <br/> <br/>I was thinking for a while between 5 and 6 for this. If there was a 5.5 button I''d''ve given it that, so I figured that rounding it up to a 6 was fair.</td>', 'Lets start off with the... ''cons'' I see in this image (take everything I say with a grain of salt--I''m far from qualified in photography, and even less in still life style shots!). This image captured my eye when I voted in the challenge. What grabbed my attention first was the glass. And the dark line that''s going down the side of it. Unfortunatly to my eyes it didn''t help the image. It made me think that the photographer was... maybe clumsy in setting up his shot with a crack showing in it.  The next thing I thought about was the oranges. They''re find oranges that I wouldn''t hesitate to eat, but they don''t have the... zest (heh heh heh) that a fruit still life needs to score well. I''m awful at these things so I''m nobody to recommend anything. But, the textures on the orange on the right isn''t very pleasant to me...  Pros: The lighting is great. Nothing''s too bright. Nothing''s too dark. It shows the droplets on the side of the glass to great effect. And it enhances the textures ov everything wonderfully (glass, oranges, knife, board). Sharpness is excellent over all the items photographed. And the wall behind is out of focus enough to not distract. Perhaps it could do with being more so, but it''s fine for me.  Comparison to take one: The colour brings a lot to this image. The whole scene feels warmer than the black and white version. This fits in with my imagination of oranges growing in tropical bliss. In the black and white version the light was a little harsher in some places. I think you overcame that well here.  Something that I''d''ve done differently: I think that some sort of continuous colour grounding and background would have suited this image well. Like what h2 does in his sometimes, if you know what I mean.  I was thinking for a while between 5 and 6 for this. If there was a 5.5 button I''d''ve given it that, so I figured that rounding it up to a 6 was fair.', '2011-06-26 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
