(6454610, 957890, 75713, '<td valign="top">A lot of work but a lot of taste too!  Nicely done - I might have lit the glass a bit more to bring out the condensation (or added some moisture beads) but the colors are lovely and it''s crisply in focus. <br/> <br/>Voted earlier</td>', 'A lot of work but a lot of taste too!  Nicely done - I might have lit the glass a bit more to bring out the condensation (or added some moisture beads) but the colors are lovely and it''s crisply in focus.  Voted earlier', '2011-06-28 01:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
