(6455316, 958232, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well, nudes or even semi nudes have a difficult time getting their due vote so I voted this high for a couple of reasons .. it stands out from truly gratuitous nudes because she really looks the part of a cowgirl who is happy!  The hat is well worn, the belly piercing is authentic looking. she is oblivious of the camera .. yep, just happy the hay making is done (grin) <br/> <br/>Voted earlier (with my hubby and sons help)</td>', 'Well, nudes or even semi nudes have a difficult time getting their due vote so I voted this high for a couple of reasons .. it stands out from truly gratuitous nudes because she really looks the part of a cowgirl who is happy!  The hat is well worn, the belly piercing is authentic looking. she is oblivious of the camera .. yep, just happy the hay making is done (grin)  Voted earlier (with my hubby and sons help)', '2011-06-29 00:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
