(6455843, 958232, 96751, '<td valign="top">If this is who I think it is, you are just a master at nude photography.  But for my tastes, I often feel that your backgrounds are not as well thought out as your subjects.  Although the bokeh in this case is really fabulous, I feel that it is really fighting for our attention.</td>', 'If this is who I think it is, you are just a master at nude photography.  But for my tastes, I often feel that your backgrounds are not as well thought out as your subjects.  Although the bokeh in this case is really fabulous, I feel that it is really fighting for our attention.', '2011-06-29 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
