(6456099, 958278, 120171, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, certainly an image that has a lot more to offer than the usual eye candy.</td>', 'Powerful image, certainly an image that has a lot more to offer than the usual eye candy.', '2011-06-29 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
