(6456434, 958023, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nope, from memory the original is better with the old lady walking away? :) Title makes sense though! You''re going to get locked up if you keep shooting there!</td>', 'Nope, from memory the original is better with the old lady walking away? :) Title makes sense though! You''re going to get locked up if you keep shooting there!', '2011-06-30 05:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456435, 958266, 108580, '<td valign="top">It''s a good macro, beetles are well focused and composed etc but the lime green pushing of the leaf and BG is OTT and thus draws attention away from the bugs. I''d have masked the leaf, BG and not overdone the saturation there, just the bugs</td>', 'It''s a good macro, beetles are well focused and composed etc but the lime green pushing of the leaf and BG is OTT and thus draws attention away from the bugs. I''d have masked the leaf, BG and not overdone the saturation there, just the bugs', '2011-06-30 05:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
