(6456795, 958284, 70896, '<td valign="top">Im having a real problem rating this picture... its not the finger in the nose, I think the lighting is great, her expression, the background... I like all that. But the fact that it is SO contrasted.... I just cant get over that! It just makes her look, I hate to say this, but like a monster!! I suppose the best pictures are the ones that get a reaction from the viewer, and this one def. has!!!</td>', 'Im having a real problem rating this picture... its not the finger in the nose, I think the lighting is great, her expression, the background... I like all that. But the fact that it is SO contrasted.... I just cant get over that! It just makes her look, I hate to say this, but like a monster!! I suppose the best pictures are the ones that get a reaction from the viewer, and this one def. has!!!', '2011-06-30 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456801, 958273, 13207, '<td valign="top">beautiful model, beautiful picture, love the softness</td>', 'beautiful model, beautiful picture, love the softness', '2011-06-30 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
