(6457238, 958186, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Congrats on top-10! Link us to the original, OK?<br/> <br/>Never mind, here it is :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=801179" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1045/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_801179.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1045/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_801179.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1045/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_801179.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Significant improvement, well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-01 00:17:02.</i></td>', 'Great shot! Congrats on top-10! Link us to the original, OK? Never mind, here it is :-)   Significant improvement, well done!', '2011-07-01 01:15:09.000000', '2011-07-01 01:17:02.000000', 0),
(6457242, 957726, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, I was close. I knew this was a familiar looking girls and scene.</td>', 'Well, I was close. I knew this was a familiar looking girls and scene.', '2011-07-01 01:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457244, 957292, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful imprint of days gone by. Something to be proud of.</td>', 'Beautiful imprint of days gone by. Something to be proud of.', '2011-07-01 01:15:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457246, 958110, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice remake of the original. That''s great no 1,2 r 3''s.</td>', 'Nice remake of the original. That''s great no 1,2 r 3''s.', '2011-07-01 01:16:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457251, 958023, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at the high-scores fishhook there! Congrats on your almost-top-10 :-)</td>', 'Wow, look at the high-scores fishhook there! Congrats on your almost-top-10 :-)', '2011-07-01 01:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457256, 958120, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great score! Great improvement. At least you beat ME, dude...</td>', 'Great score! Great improvement. At least you beat ME, dude...', '2011-07-01 01:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457260, 958278, 114285, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be your''s, sorry to see your going through a rough time. All the best :)</td>', 'I thought this might be your''s, sorry to see your going through a rough time. All the best :)', '2011-07-01 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457261, 957499, 100831, '<td valign="top">gorgeous tones and blur.... I thought I left a comment during the challenge but it doesn''t seem to be there. Love it anyway (going back to look at the original now).</td>', 'gorgeous tones and blur.... I thought I left a comment during the challenge but it doesn''t seem to be there. Love it anyway (going back to look at the original now).', '2011-07-01 01:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457263, 958023, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well done. 10 from me.</td>', 'Well done. 10 from me.', '2011-07-01 01:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457280, 958131, 76335, '<td valign="top">Such beautful, natural textures shouldn''t be possible from bits and bytes. Astounding.</td>', 'Such beautful, natural textures shouldn''t be possible from bits and bytes. Astounding.', '2011-07-01 01:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457285, 958105, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s late and I''m not making the Waldo connection. But what a fabulous portrait.</td>', 'It''s late and I''m not making the Waldo connection. But what a fabulous portrait.', '2011-07-01 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457289, 958204, 54645, '<td valign="top">Both are excellent. Well done, I particularly like how the harsh whites are defined and supported by the grain. Beyond the window.</td>', 'Both are excellent. Well done, I particularly like how the harsh whites are defined and supported by the grain. Beyond the window.', '2011-07-01 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457298, 958249, 58634, '<td valign="top">Thank you for sharing the info on your image. Congrats on a Top 10 finish. The image is incredibly gorgeous. Seriously. :D</td>', 'Thank you for sharing the info on your image. Congrats on a Top 10 finish. The image is incredibly gorgeous. Seriously. :D', '2011-07-01 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457299, 958120, 121949, '<td valign="top">Looks like we all did well on this one.</td>', 'Looks like we all did well on this one.', '2011-07-01 01:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457306, 958023, 121949, '<td valign="top">Great score on a great image!</td>', 'Great score on a great image!', '2011-07-01 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457322, 958232, 75713, '<td valign="top">I am really happy for you Leroy, in that you finally got credit for the work that you do .. Amazing lighting, especially when you consider it is all natural .... I remember asking you to come out to CA to teach me how to light people the way you do (about 2005) .. (MacClavey)I hope to see many more ribbons in the near future.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-01 13:52:07.</i></td>', 'I am really happy for you Leroy, in that you finally got credit for the work that you do .. Amazing lighting, especially when you consider it is all natural .... I remember asking you to come out to CA to teach me how to light people the way you do (about 2005) .. (MacClavey)I hope to see many more ribbons in the near future.', '2011-07-01 01:36:57.000000', '2011-07-01 14:52:07.000000', 0),
(6457332, 958177, 75713, '<td valign="top">Superb - nothing more to say!</td>', 'Superb - nothing more to say!', '2011-07-01 01:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457336, 958131, 117474, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge. Gorgeously lit and grain is wonderful too.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge. Gorgeously lit and grain is wonderful too.', '2011-07-01 01:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457342, 958232, 72670, '<td valign="top">WTF!<br/> <br/>Hell has frozen over!! What next..you on Site Council? DPC is a''changin.<br/> <br/>Congrats! keep it coming :)</td>', 'WTF! Hell has frozen over!! What next..you on Site Council? DPC is a''changin. Congrats! keep it coming :)', '2011-07-01 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457363, 957724, 69008, '<td valign="top">It''s very nice how the turbulent clouds mirror the tracked up sand in the lower right.  Too bad you couldn''t have known about this cloud formation a few minutes earlier so that you would have had more composition opportunities.</td>', 'It''s very nice how the turbulent clouds mirror the tracked up sand in the lower right.  Too bad you couldn''t have known about this cloud formation a few minutes earlier so that you would have had more composition opportunities.', '2011-07-01 01:55:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457369, 958284, 123348, '<td valign="top">I am really surprised this did not ribbon, but you have a magnificent shot here!</td>', 'I am really surprised this did not ribbon, but you have a magnificent shot here!', '2011-07-01 01:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457381, 957779, 64446, '<td valign="top">A very nice image... under appreciated, imo.</td>', 'A very nice image... under appreciated, imo.', '2011-07-01 02:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457393, 958177, 69008, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2011-07-01 02:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457399, 957295, 113156, '<td valign="top">Stunning, congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Stunning, congrats on the blue.', '2011-07-01 02:22:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457401, 958177, 113156, '<td valign="top">Excellent Wendy, your patience paid off.</td>', 'Excellent Wendy, your patience paid off.', '2011-07-01 02:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457402, 958177, 112972, '<td valign="top">Great moment!  What a capture!  Congrats!</td>', 'Great moment!  What a capture!  Congrats!', '2011-07-01 02:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457403, 958232, 112972, '<td valign="top">Glad to see you get rewarded for what you love shooting!  Big congrats!</td>', 'Glad to see you get rewarded for what you love shooting!  Big congrats!', '2011-07-01 02:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457404, 958232, 113156, '<td valign="top">Really pleased this is up here, it so deserves to be, congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Really pleased this is up here, it so deserves to be, congrats on the ribbon.', '2011-07-01 02:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457407, 957724, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch, missed that magic 6 by the slightest hair! Doncha'' hate that? I must say I am bewildered that the very similar earlier entry pulled a high 6 and this didn''t get near it. Popular appeal is an unpredictable thing for those of us that don''t shoot squirrels.</td>', 'Ouch, missed that magic 6 by the slightest hair! Doncha'' hate that? I must say I am bewildered that the very similar earlier entry pulled a high 6 and this didn''t get near it. Popular appeal is an unpredictable thing for those of us that don''t shoot squirrels.', '2011-07-01 02:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457408, 958094, 113156, '<td valign="top">Great top ten finish, this was my favorite, congrats.</td>', 'Great top ten finish, this was my favorite, congrats.', '2011-07-01 02:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457412, 957724, 54645, '<td valign="top">A wild image, and certainly a strange sky! I like that you created a puzzling quality to the spatial relationships with the processing.</td>', 'A wild image, and certainly a strange sky! I like that you created a puzzling quality to the spatial relationships with the processing.', '2011-07-01 02:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457423, 958274, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! Great motivation. However...my kids found it scary! Can you make it pink in Take Two 3?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ha! Great motivation. However...my kids found it scary! Can you make it pink in Take Two 3? ', '2011-07-01 02:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457425, 958259, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your finish. A very enjoyable image.</td>', 'Congrats on your finish. A very enjoyable image.', '2011-07-01 02:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457426, 958177, 98022, '<td valign="top">Great shot Wendy! Congrats on the red!</td>', 'Great shot Wendy! Congrats on the red!', '2011-07-01 02:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457429, 958177, 54645, '<td valign="top">Man. What a scene. Love the intensity.</td>', 'Man. What a scene. Love the intensity.', '2011-07-01 02:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457432, 958185, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid Lev. Did the trap door open and swallow him whole?</td>', 'Excellent candid Lev. Did the trap door open and swallow him whole?', '2011-07-01 02:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457433, 958110, 54645, '<td valign="top">Now that is a funky building.</td>', 'Now that is a funky building.', '2011-07-01 02:57:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457446, 958023, 112972, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photograph!  I love the story it tells.</td>', 'Fantastic photograph!  I love the story it tells.', '2011-07-01 03:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457449, 958238, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the cowboy coffee! The background makes the image for me. I know there is depth there, but the shades of gray make the table and background fluctuate for a 3-dimensional feel to flat.  It moves as you travel along the still life towards eye glasses and then smoke rising from the image. Funky stuff. I like it.</td>', 'I like the cowboy coffee! The background makes the image for me. I know there is depth there, but the shades of gray make the table and background fluctuate for a 3-dimensional feel to flat.  It moves as you travel along the still life towards eye glasses and then smoke rising from the image. Funky stuff. I like it.', '2011-07-01 03:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457451, 958105, 54645, '<td valign="top">Yes, totally thrilled to be posing for you mom! Excellent toned BW.</td>', 'Yes, totally thrilled to be posing for you mom! Excellent toned BW.', '2011-07-01 03:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457456, 957499, 54645, '<td valign="top">An engaging portrait.</td>', 'An engaging portrait.', '2011-07-01 03:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457458, 958296, 54645, '<td valign="top">The bird looks full, completely gorged on some sort of carcass. Strikes me as a vulture (?).</td>', 'The bird looks full, completely gorged on some sort of carcass. Strikes me as a vulture (?).', '2011-07-01 03:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457460, 957292, 54645, '<td valign="top">Your sensor was in competition with the subject for who would produce the most interesting "grain". It actually has a feeling of a found still life, rather than a fossil at home. Well done.</td>', 'Your sensor was in competition with the subject for who would produce the most interesting "grain". It actually has a feeling of a found still life, rather than a fossil at home. Well done.', '2011-07-01 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457463, 958183, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! No Johnny Walker needed.</td>', 'Ha! No Johnny Walker needed.', '2011-07-01 03:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457464, 958211, 54645, '<td valign="top">You are aging well!</td>', 'You are aging well!', '2011-07-01 03:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457466, 958131, 62357, '<td valign="top">Ben, I didn''t even look at this challenge, never mind vote, but I saw this today and was blown away by it.  It did incredibly well considering it''s a pinhole!  Just love it.</td>', 'Ben, I didn''t even look at this challenge, never mind vote, but I saw this today and was blown away by it.  It did incredibly well considering it''s a pinhole!  Just love it.', '2011-07-01 03:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457471, 958232, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image of a gorgeous woman. MANY, many congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Leroy. Also congrats on your first ribbon and new PB.</td>', 'Gorgeous image of a gorgeous woman. MANY, many congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Leroy. Also congrats on your first ribbon and new PB.', '2011-07-01 03:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457472, 958177, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great capture, Wendy. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Great capture, Wendy. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2011-07-01 03:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457474, 957295, 52549, '<td valign="top">WOW! Fantastic image. Congrats on your ribbon, Allen. You''re on a roll, keep it up.</td>', 'WOW! Fantastic image. Congrats on your ribbon, Allen. You''re on a roll, keep it up.', '2011-07-01 03:38:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457486, 958131, 62357, '<td valign="top">Wow, I only just looked at your ISO setting.  That''s amazing, I would never have thought of doing that.  Mind you, I don''t think my camera goes anywhere near that high!</td>', 'Wow, I only just looked at your ISO setting.  That''s amazing, I would never have thought of doing that.  Mind you, I don''t think my camera goes anywhere near that high!', '2011-07-01 04:03:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457487, 957724, 96751, '<td valign="top">Serious drama in that sky, Bear.</td>', 'Serious drama in that sky, Bear.', '2011-07-01 04:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457493, 958131, 96751, '<td valign="top">6.2 with a pinhole image.  Quite a feat in and of itself.  Congrats, Ben.</td>', '6.2 with a pinhole image.  Quite a feat in and of itself.  Congrats, Ben.', '2011-07-01 04:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457495, 958211, 3585, '<td valign="top">From a Brown to another! The improvement is not strikingly obvious...<br/>I guess this implements the French saying: "Le mieux est l''ennemi du bien" <i>("The "better" is the ennemi of the "well done")</i></td>', 'From a Brown to another! The improvement is not strikingly obvious...I guess this implements the French saying: "Le mieux est l''ennemi du bien" ("The "better" is the ennemi of the "well done")', '2011-07-01 04:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457497, 958131, 40391, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 as I really quite liked it.  But to be honest, if I had known this was achieved by pin-hole I would have scored it higher.  I dont just vote on the how the image makes me feel (although that is my main driver of a vote) but I also vote on meeting the challenge and the effort/skill/luck in getting the shot.  You have inspired me to investigate this type of photography and hopefully, in a decade or two, I might be able to produce something as special as this.  Truly wonderful and inspiring.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 as I really quite liked it.  But to be honest, if I had known this was achieved by pin-hole I would have scored it higher.  I dont just vote on the how the image makes me feel (although that is my main driver of a vote) but I also vote on meeting the challenge and the effort/skill/luck in getting the shot.  You have inspired me to investigate this type of photography and hopefully, in a decade or two, I might be able to produce something as special as this.  Truly wonderful and inspiring.', '2011-07-01 04:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457498, 958232, 28742, '<td valign="top">Implied Nudity rules on DPC. ;-) Wow! From exile to master - you da man, Leroy! Congratulations!</td>', 'Implied Nudity rules on DPC. ;-) Wow! From exile to master - you da man, Leroy! Congratulations!', '2011-07-01 04:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457500, 958177, 28742, '<td valign="top">No 1s, No 2s, No 3s?? You''re trollproof! :) Congrats, Wendo!</td>', 'No 1s, No 2s, No 3s?? You''re trollproof! :) Congrats, Wendo!', '2011-07-01 04:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457502, 957295, 28742, '<td valign="top">Clearly MUCH improved, as evidenced by the score! Well done!</td>', 'Clearly MUCH improved, as evidenced by the score! Well done!', '2011-07-01 04:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457503, 958236, 28742, '<td valign="top">I think it is better than the original (text or not), even though the score does not reflect that.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=779508" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1015/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_779508.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1015/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_779508.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1015/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_779508.jpg"/></a> <br/>Another beautiful shot of Sydney and a great finish. Congrats, Greg.</td>', 'I think it is better than the original (text or not), even though the score does not reflect that. Another beautiful shot of Sydney and a great finish. Congrats, Greg.', '2011-07-01 04:32:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457516, 958236, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stuff.', '2011-07-01 05:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457517, 958232, 50231, '<td valign="top">Well F**king Done!!!!!<br/> <br/>''Bout damn time my brotha!</td>', 'Well F**king Done!!!!! ''Bout damn time my brotha!', '2011-07-01 05:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457519, 958131, 60915, '<td valign="top">Hey, nice work, man!<br/>I think the hand placement is what make this work so well and sets it apart from just another portrait! : )</td>', 'Hey, nice work, man!I think the hand placement is what make this work so well and sets it apart from just another portrait! : )', '2011-07-01 05:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457520, 958232, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, 7+ score, and new personal best! A trifecta that was too long coming.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, 7+ score, and new personal best! A trifecta that was too long coming.', '2011-07-01 05:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457523, 958232, 60915, '<td valign="top">Hey Congrats on your first ribbon, Mr Leroy! : ) Very nice work, man!</td>', 'Hey Congrats on your first ribbon, Mr Leroy! : ) Very nice work, man!', '2011-07-01 05:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457524, 958131, 123833, '<td valign="top">I gave it an 8. Deserved a higher score. Beautiful.</td>', 'I gave it an 8. Deserved a higher score. Beautiful.', '2011-07-01 05:45:03.000000', NULL, 0);
